The Mine Opening~
  With the royal reserves bled dry by three years of war with the Fire 
Giants, the treasury is in dire need of more silver. The Earl has been
pushing the miners and Tunnel Wizard to the brink of exhaustion.
  The Wizards have warned the Earl several times of the hazards of 
mining an unblessed mine, but to no avail. The Earl fears the Fire 
Giants more than the wrath of the stone giant god.
