simply folds inward.  There is no opportunity to cryout or even cringe in 
fear as a buttress of stone loses its hold on the canyon wall and comes 
rushing down the slope.  The churning mass spreads across the road and 
spills over the Wyrm River's steep bank, rumbling across the broad ribbon 
of ice and crashing against the far side of the canyon.
